{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":24.440000534057617,"text":"A small marble figure kneeling, wringing out her hair after coming out of the sea. She is one of the calmest ancient figures anywhere. She is not posing, not looking at anybody, just doing something ordinary. She was carved around the first century BC. The marble is worked finely in the hair, where you can see the locks hanging heavy with water, which is extremely hard to carve in stone.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0,"end":0.5199999809265137},{"word":"small","start":0.5199999809265137,"end":0.9399999976158142},{"word":"marble","start":0.9399999976158142,"end":1.2799999713897705},{"word":"figure","start":1.2799999713897705,"end":1.7400000095367432},{"word":"kneeling","start":1.7400000095367432,"end":2.299999952316284},{"word":"wringing","start":2.940000057220459,"end":2.940000057220459},{"word":"out","start":2.940000057220459,"end":3.240000009536743},{"word":"her","start":3.240000009536743,"end":3.4200000762939453},{"word":"hair","start":3.4200000762939453,"end":3.680000066757202},{"word":"after","start":3.680000066757202,"end":4.059999942779541},{"word":"coming","start":4.059999942779541,"end":4.360000133514404},{"word":"out","start":4.360000133514404,"end":4.519999980926514},{"word":"of","start":4.519999980926514,"end":4.699999809265137},{"word":"the","start":4.699999809265137,"end":4.920000076293945},{"word":"sea","start":4.920000076293945,"end":5},{"word":"She","start":5.71999979019165,"end":5.820000171661377},{"word":"is","start":5.820000171661377,"end":6.039999961853027},{"word":"one","start":6.039999961853027,"end":6.159999847412109},{"word":"of","start":6.159999847412109,"end":6.260000228881836},{"word":"the","start":6.260000228881836,"end":6.840000152587891},{"word":"calmest","start":6.840000152587891,"end":7.059999942779541},{"word":"ancient","start":7.059999942779541,"end":7.480000019073486},{"word":"figures","start":7.480000019073486,"end":7.78000020980835},{"word":"anywhere